stdexec 6d7ad689: a zero xorshift seed is replaced by the default seed.

static_thread_pool seeds each worker's xorshift from std::random_device as
rd() << 31 | rd(). A seed of 0 makes xorshift return 0 for ever, and a
worker's try_steal then never leaves std::uniform_int_distribution's
rejection loop when the victim count is not a power of two (15 victims in a
16-thread pool, 3 in a 4-thread one). That worker never reaches
try_remote() again, so tasks queued to it never run, and it never sees a
stop request, so the pool's destructor waits on it for ever.

Measured on a Ryzen AI MAX+ 395 (Zen 5) under WSL2, the RDSEED behaviour
AMD-SB-7055 describes: RDSEED returned 0 while reporting success, and
libstdc++'s default random_device, which uses RDSEED there, returned 0 for
about 98% of draws. With 32 processes of 16 threads seeding at once,
3163 of 10240 seeds were 0; the blake3pp test suite then hung with pool
workers spinning in try_steal on a zero seed. rdrand and /dev/urandom
returned no zeros.

This is the xorshift.hpp change of stdexec d387428c (NVIDIA/stdexec#2315,
"Fix xorshift zero-seed lockup"), rebased on 6d7ad689, where its hunks
differ only in line offsets. Applied by cmake/StdFeatures.cmake to every
build. Drop it once the stdexec pin reaches d387428c.

--- a/include/exec/detail/xorshift.hpp
+++ b/include/exec/detail/xorshift.hpp
@@ -45,7 +45,7 @@ namespace experimental::execution
     friend auto operator==(xorshift const &, xorshift const &) -> bool = default;
 
     xorshift()
-      : m_seed(0xc1f651c67c62c6e0ull)
+      : m_seed(default_seed)
     {}
 
     explicit xorshift(std::random_device &rd)
@@ -54,12 +54,16 @@ namespace experimental::execution
     }
 
     explicit xorshift(std::uint64_t seed)
-      : m_seed(seed)
+      : m_seed(seed == 0 ? default_seed : seed)
     {}
 
     void seed(std::random_device &rd)
     {
       m_seed = std::uint64_t(rd()) << 31 | std::uint64_t(rd());
+      if (m_seed == 0)
+      {
+        m_seed = default_seed;
+      }
     }
 
     auto operator()() -> result_type
@@ -78,7 +82,8 @@ namespace experimental::execution
     }
 
    private:
-    std::uint64_t m_seed;
+    static constexpr std::uint64_t default_seed = 0xc1f651c67c62c6e0ull;
+    std::uint64_t                  m_seed;
   };
 
 }  // namespace experimental::execution
